			"Message": "style(Worker): Normalize ESBuild configuration formatting and indentation\n\nReformat ESBuild configuration files in `Configuration/ESBuild/` and the source `Source/Configuration/ESBuild/` to adhere to the project's strict formatting standards. Expand collapsed control flow statements and multi-line object properties into readable blocks, ensuring consistent indentation and line breaks.\n\nThese changes improve the maintainability of `Target.js`, `Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js`, and `Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js` without altering the underlying build logic or output behavior. The formatting now aligns with the established PascalCase naming convention and readable code style across the Worker element.",
