				3
			],
			"Message": "style(Worker): Normalize ESBuild configuration syntax and remove redundancy\n\nReformat the ESBuild configuration files in `Configuration/ESBuild/` to strictly adhere to the project's PascalCase naming convention and readable formatting standards. Transform minified or compressed variable names (e.g., `i`, `t`, `o`) into descriptive PascalCase identifiers (`On`, `Current`, `Target_default`).\n\nExplicitly expand collapsed control flow and destructuring statements in `Target.js` and `Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js` to ensure maintainability. Remove the redundant `Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js` file, establishing `Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js` as the single source of truth for build logic.\n\nThese changes restore consistency across the Worker element's build pipeline, ensuring all build scripts align with the strict formatting guidelines without altering the underlying build output or behavior.",
